━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ MarkdownBench

+ window MarkdownBenchWindow
+ scene DisplayScene
+ canvas RasterCanvas
+ session CodeSession

────────────────────
+ This
    - source String
    - caret-text String
    - reveal-text String? = null

.. window = MarkdownBenchWindow()
window.open()
scene = DisplayScene(2, black)
canvas = RasterCanvas(900, 800, 2, black)
session = CodeSession(source)
session.move-to(source.find(caret-text, 0) ?? 0)
window.editor.show(session)
if reveal-text
    window.editor.reveal-line(session.text.line-at(source.find(reveal-text, 0) ?? 0))
. ignored = frame(true)

────────────────────
+ do frame Size
    - builds = false

. queue = window.markup-batch-root!.markup-batch-queue
queue.checkpoint()
. checkpoints Size = 1
while queue.actions && checkpoints < 64
    queue.checkpoint()
    checkpoints += 1
window.layout()
if builds
    scene.build(window)
else
    scene.update(window)
scene.commit()
scene.frame(canvas)
= checkpoints

────────────────────
+ do type Size
    - keys Size

. checksum Size = 0
for key in 0 .. < keys
    if key % 15 == 14
        window.editor.perform(TextCommand.insert-newline)
    else
        window.editor.insert-text("x")
    checksum += frame()
= checksum + session.text.length

────────────────────
+ do sweep Size
    - step Length

. scroller = markdown-bench-scroller(window)!
. checksum Size = 0
while scroller.scroll-y < scroller.scroll-max.y
    . ignored = scroller.scroll-by(Point(0, step), ScrollCause.wheel)
    checksum += frame()
while scroller.scroll-y > 0
    . ignored = scroller.scroll-by(Point(0, -step), ScrollCause.wheel)
    checksum += frame()
= checksum

────────────────────
+ do close

scene.close()
canvas.close()
window.close()

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ MarkdownBenchWindow is Window

────────────────────

<This • flex-col
    size = Dimensions(900, 800)
    <MarkdownReferenceScope • flex-col flex:1
        <MarkdownEditor editor • flex:1
            column-width = 820
            column-padding = Insets(32, 40, 64, 40)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do markdown-bench-scroller Box?
    - box Box

for child in RenderedChildCursor(box)
    =? child if child.is-scroll-axis-enabled(Orientation.vertical)
    . found = markdown-bench-scroller(child)
    =? found if found
= null

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ markdown-bench-document String
    - sections Size

"\n".join(markdown-bench-section(each) in 0 .. < sections)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ ¶ markdown-bench-section
    - section Size

## Section $section

Paragraph ${section * 2} has **strong text**, *emphasis*, `inline code`, and [a link](https://example.com/$section). It runs long enough to wrap across a few lines in the editor column.

- First item $section
- Second item with `code`
  - Nested item
- Third item

> Quoted note $section stays in the document.

```
let value = $section
print(value)
```

| Name | Value |
|------|-------|
| a$section | ${section * 3} |
| b$section | ${section * 5} |

Paragraph ${section * 2 + 1} closes the section.${"\n"}

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ markdown-bench-table-document String
    - tables Size
    - rows Size

"".join(markdown-bench-table(each, rows) in 0 .. < tables)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ ¶ markdown-bench-table
    - table Size
    - rows Size

## Table $table

Table $table lists every callback site with its **verdict** and the `cursor` state at invocation.

| # | file:line | callback | paths | cursor state at invocation | per-exit values / side effects | verdict |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
$lines
Table $table closes with a short paragraph.${"\n\n"}

════════════════════
.. lines = "".join(markdown-bench-table-row(table, each) in 0 .. < rows)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ ¶ markdown-bench-table-row
    - table Size
    - row Size

| T${table}-${row} | match.ts:${1000 + row} (`StreamMatchMaker.next`) | `ended()` if defined, else `failed(null)` (${1600 + row}) | 1 | fresh `nonexists` block after condjump on stream-read | none; failedBuf constant `null`. Caller emits **nothing after** and the continuation decides | **SAFE** per se; joins at the parent group |${"\n"}
